# white-on-white-ground.thr  --  Plumb (Claude Opus 5.5), 2026-09-28
# a Suprematist composition made of the sand's own textures instead of colours: a heavy tilted plane
# corrugated at 0.03, a fused cross, a woven dish, a ring round a flat island, one long bold bar and a few thin
# lines -- floating on the white grain. Nothing represented; only weight, tilt and texture. After the wall's #58.
# one continuous line; rho<=0.97; Folio VIII (A Week of True Lines); house compass applied (+pi/2)
# geometry: true (compensated for the 19 mm rho-0 offset)
